    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You're the new keeper of a forgotten chapel! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span><i>But by sunrise, you might vanish like the others....</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use whatever you can to survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have your cleaning supplies, and you're not alone. Fight off grotesque creatures by lighting fires, hurling trash, or smashing them with your broom \u2014 but every action costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete your chores\u2026 or disappear.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the chapel floors. Empty the trash bins. Maintain the graveyard and keep the lights on. If the sun rises and your duties are unfinished, you\u2019ll meet a horrible fate....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep an eye on the ticking clock.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your smartwatch is your lifeline. Track your health, stamina, remaining chores, fuel levels \u2014 and the relentless approach of sunrise. Every second counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story buried in dust and shadow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the chapel\u2019s past, and learn why this sacred place has become a battleground between the mundane and the monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You're the new keeper of a forgotten chapel! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/1ac317bfad0cacb1bd60d6bfc328356a.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span><i>But by sunrise, you might vanish like the others....</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use whatever you can to survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have your cleaning supplies, and you're not alone. Fight off grotesque creatures by lighting fires, hurling trash, or smashing them with your broom \u2014 but every action costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/8501407bcf5ac8764dd1e179b2683c66.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete your chores\u2026 or disappear.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the chapel floors. Empty the trash bins. Maintain the graveyard and keep the lights on. If the sun rises and your duties are unfinished, you\u2019ll meet a horrible fate....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/e98f9ec74a67cb6936f5acd793c444aa.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep an eye on the ticking clock.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your smartwatch is your lifeline. Track your health, stamina, remaining chores, fuel levels \u2014 and the relentless approach of sunrise. Every second counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/b63d9104e5ad6a7a0aa02b13c8d6d04f.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story buried in dust and shadow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the chapel\u2019s past, and learn why this sacred place has become a battleground between the mundane and the monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.poster.webp?t=1754533581\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666000/extras/467dfb92b0a58f1896ea7f96477f5998.webp?t=1754533581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Tend to a cursed chapel at the edge of town, or be swallowed by what sleeps beneath it. Clean, survive, and unravel a rotting mystery in this surreal horror game of routine, decay, and sacrifice.",
